SELECT DISTINCT t."repo":"name"::STRING AS "repo_name"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS_DATE"."YEAR"."_2017" t
WHERE t."type" = 'WatchEvent'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: View a sample of watcher identifiers (actor IDs) together with the repo they watched.
